{"title": "Gold Plating", "pageid": 18832, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Gold_Plating", "categories": ["Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Gold Plating</b> is a passive feature that grants increased Constitution, Armour Class, and Hit Points\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>This creature has been blessed by Mammon, giving them a second skin of gold that increases their <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">Constitution</a> to 20 and their base <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/38px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Armour Class\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png/25px-Armour_Class_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ae/Armour_Class_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Armour_Class\" title=\"Armour Class\">Armour Class</a> to 15, and grants an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">66 hit points</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hit Points\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Hit_points\" title=\"Hit points\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Hit Points</span></a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Gilded_Hellsboar\" title=\"Gilded Hellsboar\">Gilded Hellsboar</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gilded_Imp\" title=\"Gilded Imp\">Gilded Imp</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Gilded_Minotaur\" title=\"Gilded Minotaur\">Gilded Minotaur</a></li></ul>\n</div>      \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715053213\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.032 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 880/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 5555/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 2715/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 292/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643644/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   27.916      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   27.916      1 -total\n 36.54%   10.200      2 Template:Icon_link\n 35.20%    9.826      2 Template:Icon_text\n 32.27%    9.008      1 Template:Armour_Class\n 31.31%    8.742      1 Template:WeaponProperty\n 31.08%    8.677      8 Template:Trim\n 23.83%    6.652      2 Template:Ifempty\n 12.00%    3.350      1 Template:Passive_weapons_list\n 11.29%    3.151      1 Template:Mai